trix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}22x-y &=13 \\\\ -x-y &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"] [:db/add "f65927bb-b837-57c4-a3fa-05b6fde902d8" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}22x-y &=13 \\\\ -x-y &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}22 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}22 & -1 & 13 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"] [:db/add "f65927bb-b837-57c4-a3fa-05b6fde902d8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "f65927bb-b837-57c4-a3fa-05b6fde902d8" :question/answer-fields "75e34aa7-9c2b-5bf2-b596-31237cc20096"] [:db/ensure "f65927bb-b837-57c4-a3fa-05b6fde902d8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059768 :knowledge-point/questions "f65927bb-b837-57c4-a3fa-05b6fde902d8"] [:db/add "3ff3a68c-8a12-50a5-a06b-f1e63175980c" :answer/id #uuid "3ff3a68c-8a12-50a5-a06b-f1e63175980c"] [:db/add "3ff3a68c-8a12-50a5-a06b-f1e63175980c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3ff3a68c-8a12-50a5-a06b-f1e63175980c" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-23 & -1 & 12 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "3ff3a68c-8a12-50a5-a06b-f1e63175980c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "11d753ff-6760-5408-b431-ad6a05c97a8a" :answer/id #uuid "11d753ff-6760-5408-b431-ad6a05c97a8a"] [:db/add "11d753ff-6760-5408-b431-ad6a05c97a8a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "11d753ff-6760-5408-b431-ad6a05c97a8a" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & -1 & 12 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -23\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "11d753ff-6760-5408-b431-ad6a05c97a8a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d72